enchantment.full_moon=Full Moon
enchantment.carianstyle.full_moon.desc=At night: healing received +25%%. Upon lethal damage, prevents death and restores 10%% max HP per second for 10s, with 50%% damage negation during that time (180s cooldown, halved at night). (If the main-hand weapon has Dark Moon: the restoration and negation last twice as long.)
enchantment.ancestral_spirits=Ancestral Spirit
enchantment.carianstyle.ancestral_spirits.desc=Gain 50%% magic damage negation. After taking damage, restore 5%% of lost HP over 10s.
enchantment.broken_star=Starscourge
enchantment.carianstyle.broken_star.desc=At or above 50%% HP: damage dealt +50%%. Below 50%% HP: gain 25%% damage negation. (Both effects are doubled at night.)
enchantment.dark_abandoned_child=Forsaken Child of Darkness
enchantment.carianstyle.dark_abandoned_child.desc=Fully charged attacks are converted to magic damage, ignore armor, and steal one random buff from the target. At night: gain 10%% damage negation and restore 1.5%% max HP per second.
enchantment.blasphemy=Blasphemy
enchantment.carianstyle.blasphemy.desc=On killing a creature with a melee hit, drain 10%% of its max HP and restore 10%% of your max hunger.
enchantment.bad_omen=Omen
enchantment.carianstyle.bad_omen.desc=Fully charged attacks inflict Omen for 10s: damage taken +25%%, healing received -50%%, attack power and attack speed -20%%. On a fully charged hit against an Omen-afflicted target, half of the damage cannot be negated (killing the target outright if that half is lethal). Hits that are not fully charged deal 50%% less damage to Omen-afflicted targets.
enchantment.living_corpse=Those Who Live in Death
enchantment.carianstyle.living_corpse.desc=Upon lethal damage, prevents death and fully restores HP, then bleeds out rapidly and dies. (Dying while bleeding does not revive you again; 240s cooldown.)
enchantment.giant_flame=Giantsflame Take Thee
enchantment.carianstyle.giant_flame.desc=Gain 0.25%% damage negation for every 1%% of HP remaining. Immune to fire damage, converting it to healing instead (at most twice per second). While ablaze: melee attackers take fire damage equal to 50%% of the damage they deal to you.
enchantment.blood=Rapture of Blood
enchantment.carianstyle.blood.desc=Every third fully charged hit (on any target) drains 12%% of the target's current HP (restoring at most 18%% of your max HP) and inflicts blood loss for 1.5s, draining 7%% of its max HP. (If the main-hand weapon also has Bloody Slash and Blood Tax: blood loss +7%%.)
enchantment.mikaela_blade=Miquella's Blade
enchantment.carianstyle.mikaela_blade.desc=Base damage -60%%. Each fully charged attack grants a stack (no limit): damage dealt +20%%, damage taken +10%%. All stacks are lost if you go 2s without a fully charged attack.
enchantment.time_reversal=Placidusax's Rewind
enchantment.carianstyle.time_reversal.desc=Upon lethal damage, prevents death and grants 5s of invulnerability. Damage taken during that time is stored and reflected back at attackers; burns and bleeding drain no HP during it and aren't stored. When it ends, restore HP equal to 25%% of the stored damage (300s cooldown).
enchantment.doomed_death=Destined Death
enchantment.carianstyle.doomed_death.desc=Fully charged attacks burn the target for 2%% of its max HP plus 20%% of the original damage over 2s, and reduce its max HP by 10%% for 45s. Burn damage halved against bosses.
enchantment.warrior=Warrior
enchantment.carianstyle.warrior.desc=Melee damage dealt +25%%. On killing a creature in melee, restore 25%% of lost HP. Half of the damage you take is converted into a slow drain over 3s.
enchantment.golden_law=Golden Order
enchantment.carianstyle.golden_law.desc=Damage dealt +15%%, scaling with lost HP up to +60%%. Gain 15%% damage negation. Immune to any hit dealing 15%% or less of your current HP, and fully negate one hit every 5s.

enchantment.offer_sword=Offering Blade
enchantment.carianstyle.offer_sword.desc=At full HP, attacks deal an additional [Level] x 10%% damage.
enchantment.corrupted_wing_sword=Rotten Winged Sword
enchantment.carianstyle.corrupted_wing_sword.desc=Fully charged attacks add a stack (up to 20; each stack fades after 15s). Each stack: damage dealt +[Level] x 0.75%%.
enchantment.scarlet_rot=Scarlet Rot
enchantment.carianstyle.scarlet_rot.desc=Fully charged attacks inflict Scarlet Rot 1 for [Level] x 20s: 3%% of current HP plus 0.075%% of max HP as magic damage per second (ignores armor and Resistance, +33%% per level), healing received -25%%, armor -50%%.
enchantment.death_blade=Blade of Death
enchantment.carianstyle.death_blade.desc=Base damage reduced to 50%%. Fully charged attacks burn the target for 50%% of the original damage over 5s and reduce its max HP by 10%% for 45s. Burn damage halved against bosses.
enchantment.epilepsy_fire=Unendurable Frenzy
enchantment.carianstyle.epilepsy_fire.desc=Fully charged attacks burn you for 20%% of your max HP over 3s, and burn the target for [Level] x 0.1 times that self-inflicted damage. While burning, healing received -90%%.
enchantment.waterfowl_flurry=Waterfowl Dance
enchantment.carianstyle.waterfowl_flurry.desc=Fully charged attacks split their damage evenly into [Level] + 1 strikes landing 0.1s apart (ignoring hit invulnerability).
enchantment.fire_gives_power=Flame, Grant Me Strength
enchantment.carianstyle.fire_gives_power.desc=Attacks set you ablaze for 10s. While ablaze: damage dealt +[Level] x 7.5%%, and gain [Level] x 3.75%% negation against non-magic damage.
enchantment.healing_by_fire=Flame, Heal Me
enchantment.carianstyle.healing_by_fire.desc=While ablaze: on being attacked, [Level] x 2.5%% chance to remove one debuff (levels on all armor pieces add up). Each removal grants a permanent damage-absorbing shield worth 10%% of your max HP.
enchantment.shelter_of_fire=Flame, Protect Me
enchantment.carianstyle.shelter_of_fire.desc=While ablaze: gain [Level] x 2%% damage negation and restore [Level] x 0.1%% max HP per second (each armor piece applies separately).
enchantment.exclude=Rejection
enchantment.carianstyle.exclude.desc=On being attacked by a creature, knock back every creature within ([Level] - 1) x 0.75 + 5 blocks with a force of 0.5 (up to 20).
enchantment.topps_stand=Thops's Barrier
enchantment.carianstyle.topps_stand.desc=No creature within 6 blocks, including yourself, can deal or take magic damage.
enchantment.causality_principle=Law of Causality
enchantment.carianstyle.causality_principle.desc=After taking damage from creatures 5 times, deal retaliatory damage equal to [Level] x 75%% of that damage to every creature within [Level] x 3 blocks (at most 10). (1s cooldown; [Level] is the total across all worn armor.)
enchantment.beast_vitality=Bestial Vitality
enchantment.carianstyle.beast_vitality.desc=All buff and debuff durations +[Level] x 30%%.
enchantment.freezing_earthquake=Hoarfrost Stomp
enchantment.carianstyle.freezing_earthquake.desc=Triggers when a single hit from a creature deals at least 25%% of your max HP (levels on all armor pieces add up): launch up to 20 grounded creatures within 3 + ([Level] - 1) x 2 blocks (max 10) with a force of [Level] x 0.35 and inflict Frostbite [Level] for [Level] x 5s: movement speed -[Level] x 7.5%%, and [Level] x 0.25%% of max HP as physical damage every 0.5s.
enchantment.precise_lightning=Honed Bolt
enchantment.carianstyle.precise_lightning.desc=When hit by a ranged attack, call down [Level] lightning bolts on the attacker (levels add up across armor pieces), each dealing 30%% of the damage taken (x2 in rain, x4 in thunderstorms).
enchantment.ancient_dragon_lightning=Ancient Dragons' Lightning Strike
enchantment.carianstyle.ancient_dragon_lightning.desc=Upon lethal damage, call down up to [Level] x 100 lightning bolts on every creature within 60 blocks, at most [Level] x 15 per target. Each bolt deals 5%% of current HP plus 0.5%% of max HP (the latter x2 in rain, x4 in thunderstorms). (90s cooldown.)
enchantment.calamity=Shabriri's Calamity
enchantment.carianstyle.calamity.desc=§cCurse§r Damage taken x1.5. Hostile creatures strongly prefer to target you.
enchantment.furnace_feather=Crucible Feather
enchantment.carianstyle.furnace_feather.desc=Damage taken x(total level across your armor x 50%% + 100%%). I-frames after being hit +[Level] x 150%%, and gain Speed [Level] and Jump Boost [Level] for [Level] x 2s (these two use your highest piece and do not stack).
enchantment.loretta_big_bow=Loretta's Greatbow
enchantment.carianstyle.loretta_big_bow.desc=Arrow damage +50%%, and arrows explode on impact.
enchantment.loretta_trick=Loretta's Mastery
enchantment.carianstyle.loretta_trick.desc=Arrow damage -25%%, but arrows produce four large explosions on impact.
enchantment.empty_epilepsy_fire=Frenzied Burst
enchantment.carianstyle.empty_epilepsy_fire.desc=Arrow hits burn you for 10%% of your max HP over 3s, and burn the target for [Level] x 0.2 times that self-inflicted damage. While burning, healing received -90%%.
enchantment.call_star=Starcaller Cry
enchantment.carianstyle.call_star.desc=Where the arrow lands, creatures within [Level] x 2 blocks are pulled toward the center; 1s later lightning strikes every creature within [Level] blocks, dealing [Level] x 30%% of the arrow's base damage (x3 at night).
enchantment.invisible_weapon=Unseen Blade
enchantment.carianstyle.invisible_weapon.desc=After dealing damage, become invisible for [Level] x 1s (3x as long when hitting with an arrow).
enchantment.hard_arrow=Rigid Arrow
enchantment.carianstyle.hard_arrow.desc=Bow damage +[Level] x 80%%. Cost: while any other creature is within 12 blocks, damage taken from creatures +[Level] x 80%% and knockback taken +[Level] x 75%%.
enchantment.eat_shit=Dung Eater
enchantment.carianstyle.eat_shit.desc=After dealing damage with a fully charged melee hit: you are nauseated for [Level] x 1.5s; the target is nauseated for [Level] x 4s and defiled for [Level] x 4s, reducing healing received by 75%%.
enchantment.moon_of_noxtura=Moon of Nokstella
enchantment.carianstyle.moon_of_noxtura.desc=At night, each second has a 2.5%% chance to make creatures within 32 blocks that are targeting you turn on another kind of creature they can see that is no farther from them than you.
enchantment.vic_dragon_thunder=Vyke's Dragonbolt
enchantment.carianstyle.vic_dragon_thunder.desc=Lightning damage negation +[Level] x 15%%. After dealing damage with a fully charged melee attack, [Level] x 5%% chance to call down lightning (chance x2 in rain, guaranteed in thunderstorms) dealing [Level] x 50%% damage (x2 in rain, x4 in thunderstorms).
enchantment.dark_moon=Dark Moon
enchantment.carianstyle.dark_moon.desc=At night: magic damage taken -25%%, fully charged melee magic damage +25%%, healing received +25%%, and gain Night Vision. When such a hit strikes a creature targeting you, it deals an extra 5%% of the creature's current HP and restores 5%% of the total damage as HP (at most 5%% of your max HP). (If your armor has Full Moon: all values +50%%.)
enchantment.blood_slash=Bloody Slash
enchantment.carianstyle.blood_slash.desc=Fully charged attacks consume 10%% of your max HP (at 10%% HP or less, you die instead) to deal an extra [Level] x 5%% of the target's current HP as damage. On a kill, restore [Level] x 2.5%% of your max HP. (If the main-hand weapon has Blood Tax: healing is doubled.)
enchantment.blood_collection=Blood Tax
enchantment.carianstyle.blood_collection.desc=On fully charged hits: damage dealt +[Level] x 0.15%% for every 1%% of HP lost. After dealing damage, restore [Level] x 2%% of lost HP. (If the main-hand weapon has Bloody Slash: healing is doubled.)
enchantment.scarlet_lonia=Scarlet Aeonia
enchantment.carianstyle.scarlet_lonia.desc=Upon lethal damage, prevents death: push away creatures within [Level] x 4 blocks and become invulnerable but immobile for 1.5s. When it ends, creatures within [Level] x 2 blocks lose [Level] x 5%% of their current HP, receive Scarlet Rot [Level] for [Level] x 10s and are knocked back with a force of [Level] x 0.75 - then you die. (Uses your highest armor piece; 90s cooldown.)
enchantment.stars_law=Stellar Order
enchantment.carianstyle.stars_law.desc=At night: healing received +50%%, movement speed +25%%. Fully charged hits inflict Frostbite 1 on the target, and taking physical damage inflicts it on the attacker, for 10s (+1 level if already applied, up to 10). Fully charged magic damage against frostbitten targets +[Frostbite Level] x 7.5%%.
enchantment.dragon_breath_corruption=Ekzykes's Decay
enchantment.carianstyle.dragon_breath_corruption.desc=Where the arrow lands, every creature within [Level] x 2 blocks - including yourself - receives Scarlet Rot [Level] for [Level] x 5s: 3%% of current HP plus 0.075%% of max HP as magic damage per second (ignores armor, +33%% per level), healing received -25%%, armor -[Level] x 50%%.
enchantment.golden_dung_turtle=Gold Scarab
enchantment.carianstyle.golden_dung_turtle.desc=Experience dropped by slain targets +[Level] x 30%%.
enchantment.hypnotic_smoke=Sleep Mist
enchantment.carianstyle.hypnotic_smoke.desc=After a fully charged attack, [Level] x 2%% chance to inflict Sleep [Level] for [Level] x 3s: blindness, unable to move, jump or attack. The first hit from a creature awakens the target, dealing +75%% + [Effect Level] x 25%% damage and clearing Sleep.
enchantment.hypnotic_arrow=St. Trina's Arrow
enchantment.carianstyle.hypnotic_arrow.desc=On an arrow hit, [Level] x 3%% chance to inflict Sleep [Level] for [Level] x 3s: blindness, unable to move, jump or attack. The first hit from a creature awakens the target, dealing +75%% + [Effect Level] x 25%% damage and clearing Sleep.
enchantment.lunge_up=Stamp (Upward Cut)
enchantment.carianstyle.lunge_up.desc=A fully charged sprinting attack cancels the sprint into a charged upward slash, launching the target with a force of [Level] x 0.3 and dealing an extra [Level] x 15%% damage.
enchantment.vowed_revenge=Vow of Vengeance
enchantment.carianstyle.vowed_revenge.desc=Damage dealt +[Level] x 2.5%% for each creature within [Level] x 2 blocks (target included, up to 20), plus a further [Level] x 5%% against the last creature that attacked you within 5s.
enchantment.patience=Endure
enchantment.carianstyle.patience.desc=When struck in melee, store [Level] x 10%% of the damage (capped at max HP x [Level] x 40%%). Your next attack releases the entire stored amount as bonus damage.
enchantment.epilepsy_spread=Contagious Fury
enchantment.carianstyle.epilepsy_spread.desc=When a hit would drop you to 30%% HP or lower: negate it, set your HP to 30%%, knock back every creature within [Level] x 4 blocks, and stay invulnerable but immobile until you die. After 1.5s those creatures burn for [Level] x 60%% of your max HP over 3s - then you die. (Uses your highest armor piece; 90s cooldown.)
enchantment.adura_moonlight_sword=Adula's Moonblade
enchantment.carianstyle.adura_moonlight_sword.desc=Fully charged attacks deal magic damage and inflict Frostbite 1 for 10s on the target and every creature within [Level] blocks of it, sparing your own kind, teammates and pets (+1 level if already applied, up to 10): movement speed -[Level] x 7.5%%, and [Level] x 0.25%% of max HP as physical damage every 0.5s (+100%% per level). (Stacking is twice as fast at night.)
enchantment.pyroxene_ice=Glintstone Icecrag
enchantment.carianstyle.pyroxene_ice.desc=Damage is converted to magic damage. Arrow hits inflict Frostbite [Level] for 10s: movement speed -[Level] x 7.5%%, and [Level] x 0.25%% of max HP as physical damage every 0.5s (+100%% per level).
enchantment.wave_stone_magic=Glintstone Fling
enchantment.carianstyle.wave_stone_magic.desc=Magic damage you deal is converted to physical damage, and damage +50%%. (Also applies to damage converted by Adula's Moonblade or Forsaken Child of Darkness.)
enchantment.fire_devoured=Flame, Devour Them All
enchantment.carianstyle.fire_devoured.desc=While ablaze: fully charged attacks deal fire damage equal to [Level] x 15%% of the damage to up to 16 other creatures within [Level] blocks of the target (sparing other players, teammates and your pets), setting them ablaze for 10s.
enchantment.black_flame_shelter=Black Flame Protection
enchantment.carianstyle.black_flame_shelter.desc=Physical damage negation +[Level] x 12.5%% (armor-ignoring damage still gets through). Cost: healing received -[Level] x 25%%.
enchantment.ancestral_spirit_horn=Ancestral Spirit's Horn
enchantment.carianstyle.ancestral_spirit_horn.desc=Magic damage negation +25%%. After taking magic damage, restore [Level] x 5%% of that damage as HP over 10s.
enchantment.regressive_principle=Law of Regression
enchantment.carianstyle.regressive_principle.desc=Frequently (about once per second) clears all buffs and debuffs from every creature within [Level] x 3 blocks (at most 8), including yourself. ([Level] is the total across all worn armor.)
enchantment.black_flame_blade=Black Flame Blade
enchantment.carianstyle.black_flame_blade.desc=Attacks burn the target for [Level] x 15%% of the original damage over 5s.
enchantment.continuous_shooting=Barrage
enchantment.carianstyle.continuous_shooting.desc=Bow draw speed x5. Arrow damage -50%%.
enchantment.long_tail_cat=Longtail Cat
enchantment.carianstyle.long_tail_cat.desc=Immune to fall damage below ([Level] - 1) x 25%% + 50%% of your max HP (levels on multiple armor pieces add up).
enchantment.godskin_swaddling=Godskin Swaddling Cloth
enchantment.carianstyle.godskin_swaddling.desc=Every 4 fully charged hits restore ([Level] - 1) x 1%% + 3%% of your max HP.
enchantment.realm_of_magic=Realm of Sorcery
enchantment.carianstyle.realm_of_magic.desc=Magic damage dealt by every creature of your kind within 6 blocks, including yourself, +50%% (worn by a player, this means every nearby player).
enchantment.beast_robust=Bestial Constitution
enchantment.carianstyle.beast_robust.desc=All buff and debuff levels are doubled, but their durations are reduced by 60%% (instant effects are unaffected).
enchantment.golden_vow=Golden Vow
enchantment.carianstyle.golden_vow.desc=Attacking or being attacked grants Golden Vow [Level] for [Level] x 2.5s: damage dealt +[Level] x 15%%, damage negation +[Level] x 10%%. (Levels from multiple armor pieces add up, capped at level 9 when attacked and level 5 when attacking.)
enchantment.blessing_of_the_erdtree=Blessing of the Erdtree
enchantment.carianstyle.blessing_of_the_erdtree.desc=Attacking or being attacked grants Blessing of the Erdtree [Level] for [Level] x 2.5s: max HP +[Level] x 15%%, and restore [Level] x 4%% of max HP whenever its remaining duration reaches a multiple of 3s (Level 1 lasts under 3s and never heals).
enchantment.protection_of_the_erdtree=Protection of the Erdtree
enchantment.carianstyle.protection_of_the_erdtree.desc=Attacking or being attacked grants Protection of the Erdtree [Level] for [Level] x 2.5s: negation against non-creature damage +[Level] x 20%%. (Levels from multiple armor pieces add up, capped at level 5; negation tops out at 100%%.)
enchantment.red_feathered_branchsword=Red-Feathered Branchsword
enchantment.carianstyle.red_feathered_branchsword.desc=At 20%% HP or below, damage dealt +[Level] x 20%%.
enchantment.blue_feathered_branchsword=Blue-Feathered Branchsword
enchantment.carianstyle.blue_feathered_branchsword.desc=At 20%% HP or below, gain [Level] x 10%% negation against damage from creatures.
enchantment.daedicar_woe=Daedicar's Woe
enchantment.carianstyle.daedicar_woe.desc=§cCurse§r Damage taken x3. I-frames after being hit -50%%.
enchantment.scholar_shield=Scholar's Shield
enchantment.carianstyle.scholar_shield.desc=While guarding: damage negation +[Level] x 7.5%% (not against environmental damage), and melee attacks reflect [Level] x 10%% of their damage back at the attacker (even when blocked).
enchantment.shield_bash=Shield Bash
enchantment.carianstyle.shield_bash.desc=When a melee attack hits you while your shield is raised, knock the attacker back with an additional force of [Level] x 0.25.
enchantment.immutable_shield=Immutable Shield
enchantment.carianstyle.immutable_shield.desc=While guarding: damage that gets past the shield -[Level] x 10%%. Each time the shield fully blocks an attack, restore [Level] x 1%% of your max HP and clear all buffs and debuffs from the attacker.
enchantment.parry=Parry
enchantment.carianstyle.parry.desc=A counterattack within 0.5s of taking a frontal melee hit on your shield deals an extra [Level] x 25%% damage (2s cooldown).
enchantment.carian_retaliation=Carian Retaliation
enchantment.carianstyle.carian_retaliation.desc=Taking magic or ranged damage while guarding summons 3 glintblades that home in on the attacker, each dealing [Level] x 20%% magic damage.
enchantment.carian_phalanx=Carian Phalanx
enchantment.carianstyle.carian_phalanx.desc=On an arrow hit, [Level] x 2%% chance to summon 9 glintblades that home in on the target, each dealing [Level] x 5%% magic damage.
enchantment.greatblade_phalanx=Greatblade Phalanx
enchantment.carianstyle.greatblade_phalanx.desc=Upon lethal damage, summon 3 greatblade glintblades that home in on the attacker, each dealing magic damage equal to [Level] x 10%% of the attacker's lost HP and producing a massive explosion (uses your highest armor piece; 300s cooldown).
enchantment.crucible_scale_talisman=Crucible Scale
enchantment.carianstyle.crucible_scale_talisman.desc=When a single hit deals at least your max HP, that damage is reduced by [Level] x 15%% (levels from multiple armor pieces add up, up to -90%%).
enchantment.concealing_veil=Concealing Veil
enchantment.carianstyle.concealing_veil.desc=While sneaking, enter stealth: other players can't see you and no creature can track you. Attacking or taking damage prevents stealth for 3s.
enchantment.blessed_dew_talisman=Blessed Dew
enchantment.carianstyle.blessed_dew_talisman.desc=While your hunger bar is full, restore [Level] x 0.2%% of your max HP per second.
enchantment.lucidity=Lucidity
enchantment.carianstyle.lucidity.desc=Debuffs you receive are one level higher, but their durations are reduced by [Level] x 15%% (levels add up across armor pieces).
enchantment.rock_blaster=Bedrock Blast
enchantment.carianstyle.rock_blaster.desc=Breaking a block with a pickaxe also breaks every connected block of the same type (within 3x3x3 at level I, 5x5x5 at level II, 7x7x7 at level III), costing 1 durability each. With 1 durability left the pickaxe refuses to mine, so it never breaks.
enchantment.lion_claw=Lion's Claw
enchantment.carianstyle.lion_claw.desc=Attacks have a 20%% chance to ignore armor and deal an extra [Level] x 15%% damage.
enchantment.corpse_piler=Corpse Piler
enchantment.carianstyle.corpse_piler.desc=Melee kills have a 50%% chance to grant a Corpse Pile stack: on fully charged attacks, each stack grants +[Level] x 1%% damage and restores [Level] x 0.05%% of max HP, up to 50 stacks (all stacks are lost after 5 minutes without gaining one; half are lost on death).
enchantment.quickstep=Quickstep
enchantment.carianstyle.quickstep.desc=Movement speed +[Level] x 20%% at most, scaling with your current lost HP (rises and falls as your HP changes).
enchantment.millicent_prosthesis=Millicent's Prosthesis
enchantment.carianstyle.millicent_prosthesis.desc=While empowered, damage dealt +[Level] x 5%%. Fully charged attacks add a stack (each: attack damage +[Level] x 1%%, attack speed +[Level] x 2%%), lasting 1.5s. At 7 stacks the damage bonus doubles, and the next fully charged attack raises it to 16 stacks lasting 3s.
enchantment.prayerful_strike=Prayerful Strike
enchantment.carianstyle.prayerful_strike.desc=In combat, charges once every 4s (the charge is lost if you don't strike within 4s of it filling, or if a creature hits you while it is ready). Your next attack deals an extra 2.5%% of your max HP plus 7.5%% of the target's current HP (at most 10%% of the target's max HP), restores the same amount of HP, and permanently raises your max HP by half that value (at most 5%% of your current maximum per hit; all of it is lost on death).
enchantment.holy_ground=Holy Ground
enchantment.carianstyle.holy_ground.desc=While guarding: every player within 16 blocks, including yourself (friend or foe), takes [Level] x 5%% less damage. Every 3s, each of them also restores [Level] x 1.5%% of max HP and gains a permanent damage-absorbing shield worth [Level] x 3%% of max HP (capped at [Level] x 33%%).
enchantment.sacred_blade=Sacred Blade
enchantment.carianstyle.sacred_blade.desc=Damage against non-undead -80%%. Against undead: deal up to an extra [Level] x 25%% damage scaling with the target's current HP. On fully charged hits, also restore 20%% of that bonus damage as HP (at most 10%% of your max HP) and permanently weaken the target's attack damage by [Level] x 5%% (stacks, up to 99%%).
enchantment.indomitable=Vow of the Indomitable
enchantment.carianstyle.indomitable.desc=Scaling with lost HP, incoming damage has up to a 75%% chance to be negated entirely.
enchantment.gravitas=Gravitas
enchantment.carianstyle.gravitas.desc=Attacks reduce the target's attack, movement and flight speed by 10%% + [Level] x 4%% for [Level] x 2s, and create a gravity field centered on you for [Level] x 4s: every creature within 12 blocks suffers -10%% attack, movement and flight speed and cannot jump.
enchantment.double_slash=Double Slash
enchantment.carianstyle.double_slash.desc=Fully charged attacks have a [Level] x 5%% + 20%% chance to trigger a follow-up strike dealing [Level] x 20%% damage (magic damage that ignores armor).
enchantment.sword_dance=Sword Dance
enchantment.carianstyle.sword_dance.desc=Targets you attack receive no i-frames. Cost: your damage is further multiplied by your attack charge (minimum 40%%).
enchantment.assassin_gambit=Assassin's Gambit
enchantment.carianstyle.assassin_gambit.desc=After taking a melee hit from a creature, become invisible for [Level] seconds. A melee hit while invisible breaks stealth and deals an extra [Level] x 25%% damage (on a critical hit, the critical multiplier is doubled instead: 1.5x -> 3x).
enchantment.blood_blade=Blood Blade
enchantment.carianstyle.blood_blade.desc=Fully charged attacks consume 15%% of your max HP (if you can't pay it you die, though a Totem of Undying can save you) to deal extra damage of up to [Level] x 33%% plus [Level] x 3.3%% of the target's current HP, scaled by your current HP ratio.
enchantment.incision=Seppuku
enchantment.carianstyle.incision.desc=Triggers on a fully charged hit at or above 75%% HP: spend 50%% of your max HP to enter Seppuku for 10s - lose 12.5%% of max HP per second (can be fatal), movement speed +120%% (decaying to +30%%), damage +40%%, attack speed +80%%, armor and armor toughness -75%%, healing received +60%%. While in Seppuku, fully charged hits restore 25%% of the damage as HP (at most 25%% of your max HP) and inflict blood loss for 1.5s, draining 7%% of the target's max HP. A melee kill extends Seppuku by 5s (up to 10s), refreshes the speed bonus and restores 10%% of your missing HP.
enchantment.green_turtle=Green Turtle
enchantment.carianstyle.green_turtle.desc=Healing received +[Level] x 7.5%%, and each heal restores up to [Level] x 0.15 extra HP, scaling with the share of HP you've lost. Levels on multiple armor pieces add up.
enchantment.howl_shabriri=Howl of Shabriri
enchantment.carianstyle.howl_shabriri.desc=Fully charged attacks burn you for 5%% of your max HP over 3s (your healing received -90%% meanwhile) and inflict Madness on the target for [Level] x 3s: armor and armor toughness -15%% and healing received -10%% per stack, up to 6 stacks. Targets at full stacks take an extra [Level] x 15%% damage.
enchantment.unsheathe=Unsheathe
enchantment.carianstyle.unsheathe.desc=Each fully charged attack has a 1%% chance to trigger an unsheathing strike: damage x[Level] x 330%%, followed by [Level] x 3.3s of -75%% attack speed. If it does not trigger, the chance increases by 0.5%% (stacking, and resetting to 1%% once triggered).
enchantment.starlight=Starlight
enchantment.carianstyle.starlight.desc=Continuously lights up where you stand at a light level of your total Starlight level across your armor x 3, up to 15 (not while standing in water or other blocks).
enchantment.black_flame_ritual=Black Flame Ritual
enchantment.carianstyle.black_flame_ritual.desc=Damage dealt +10%% for each buff you have (+20%% for each debuff). Cost: while you have any status effect, burns 5%% of your current HP per second.
enchantment.aeonia=Goddess of Rot
enchantment.carianstyle.aeonia.desc=While held in the main hand, you constantly have Scarlet Rot 1. Within 32 blocks of you: Scarlet Rot damage is raised to 250%%, rot-afflicted creatures have a 25%% chance to infect whatever they hit in melee, and when a rot-afflicted creature dies, each creature within 16 blocks has a 50%% chance to catch it for 10s. Fully charged attacks on an infected target restore 10%% of your max HP.
enchantment.sacred_order=Sacred Order
enchantment.carianstyle.sacred_order.desc=You cannot be healed. The first time you enter a world each life, gain a damage-absorbing shield worth 100%% of your max HP if you have none (changing dimensions or logging back in won't grant it again). Killing a creature grants a damage-absorbing shield worth 10%% of your max HP (capped at 300%% of max HP). While you have a shield, damage dealt +50%% and damage taken -25%%; hits that leave your shield standing reflect magic damage equal to 5%% of the remaining shield.
enchantment.dragoncrest_greatshield=Dragoncrest Greatshield
enchantment.carianstyle.dragoncrest_greatshield.desc=Each instance of physical damage taken adds a stack: armor and armor toughness +7.5%%, movement speed -1%%, lasting 30s (refreshed on each hit), up to 20 stacks. At full stacks, gain an additional 25%% physical damage negation.
enchantment.cragblade=Cragblade
enchantment.carianstyle.cragblade.desc=For 10s after dealing damage (dealing damage again restarts the timer): you cannot jump; attack power, armor and armor toughness +[Level] x 10%% each; knockback resistance +[Level] x 10%% (flat; 100%% means full immunity).
enchantment.crucible_knot_talisman=Crucible Knot
enchantment.carianstyle.crucible_knot_talisman.desc=Damage taken from attackers standing higher than you -[Level] x 25%%.
enchantment.magic_scorpion_charm=Magic Scorpion Charm
enchantment.carianstyle.magic_scorpion_charm.desc=Magic damage +[Level] x 10%%, and dealing magic damage restores [Level] x 1%% of lost HP. Cost: physical damage taken +[Level] x 10%%.
enchantment.stamp_sweep=Stamp (Sweep)
enchantment.carianstyle.stamp_sweep.desc=Fully charged sprinting attacks become a spinning slash: this hit deals +[Level] x 10%% damage, and every other creature within 3 blocks (teammates excluded) takes the same damage (up to 20).
enchantment.repeating_thrust=Repeating Thrust
enchantment.carianstyle.repeating_thrust.desc=Each fully charged hit on the same target adds a stack, and each stack gives +[Level] x 5%% damage (no cap; stacks clear after 10s without a fully charged hit, or when you switch targets).
enchantment.sky_shot=Sky Shot
enchantment.carianstyle.sky_shot.desc=Shots against targets at least 5 blocks above you deal an extra [Level] x 100%% damage plus about 30%% of the target's current HP (at full draw; scales with arrow speed). Cost: triggering it inflicts Slowness II on you for 5s.

